OL,3,GNEWSAHospital to close for six months
OL,4,Afor #2m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital is to close for six months
OL,7,Fnext year as part of a #2m upgrade,
OL,8,Fhealth bosses have said.
OL,10,FTavistock Hospital in Devon has a
OL,11,Fseven-day minor injuries unit,
OL,12,Foutpatient clinics and 13 in-patient
OL,13,Fbeds, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,14,FService said.
OL,16,FUniversity Hospitals Plymouth NHS
OL,17,FTrust, which runs the site, said
OL,18,Fupgrades were needed to ensure the
OL,19,F130-year-old hospital remained fit for
OL,20,Fpurpose.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
