OL,3,GNEWSAHospital to close for six months
OL,4,Afor #2m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FTavistock mayor Anne Johnson said she
OL,7,Fwas concerned the closure would cause
OL,8,Fissues due to the distance to
OL,9,Falternative units.
